"""Episode 20 (Year 1900) polygons, used by world_data_1900 and world_data_1882.
1825 -> 1900: France takes Algeria (1830-47), Tunisia (1881), West and Equatorial Africa, Madagascar (1896), Indochina (1858-93);
Britain takes Hong Kong (1842, New Territories 1898), all of India (Crown rule 1858), Burma (1885), Egypt (1882, occupied), the
Sudan (1898-99), Nigeria, Gold Coast, Kenya, Uganda, Rhodesia, Nyasaland, Bechuanaland, Malaya, north Borneo, Papua, Fiji;
Germany unites (1871) and takes Togo, Kamerun, South-West and East Africa, NE New Guinea (1884-85), Kiautschou (1898);
Leopold II's Congo Free State (1885); Italy unites (1861/70) and takes Eritrea and Somaliland; Portugal Angola + Mozambique;
Spain keeps Rio de Oro and Rio Muni; Ethiopia expands under Menelik II and beats Italy at Adwa (1896).
USA: Texas (1845), Oregon (1846), Mexican Cession (1848), Gadsden (1853), Alaska (1867), Hawaii, Philippines, Puerto Rico,
Guam (1898). Russia: Central Asia (1865-95), Amur and Ussuri (1858-60), Sakhalin (1875), Kwantung lease (1898).
Japan: Taiwan (1895). Balkans: Greece (1830/1881), Serbia, Montenegro, Romania (1878), Bulgaria (1878/1885)."""
